      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 231]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(A day)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "I have a pretty hectic daily schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I get up at seven o’clock every morning"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and have breakfast at 7:30 a.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I leave for school at about 7:45 a.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I meet my friends and play around a little before we go to class."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I have four morning classes that begin at 9 a.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After lunch, I have two more classes."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I finish my classes, and then I go to a private academy"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "where I study art, piano and English."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Sometimes I get tired after attending my academies."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After going to the academy,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I go home and have dinner with my family."
    },
